الطرف الايسر \frac{2}{1+z} = \frac{2}{1+\cos 2t + i \sin 2t}
= \frac{2}{2 \cos^2 t + 2i \sin t \cos t}
= \frac{2}{2 \cos t (\cos t + i \sin t)} \quad (3/2020)
= \frac{1}{\cos t} * \frac{1}{\cos t + i \sin t} * \frac{\cos t - i \sin t}{\cos t - i \sin t}
= \frac{1}{\cos t} * \frac{\cos t - i \sin t}{\cos^2 t + \sin^2 t}
= \frac{\cos t - i \sin t}{\cos t} = \frac{\cos t}{\cos t} - i \frac{\sin t}{\cos t}
= 1 - i \tan t = الطرف الايمن
